	(text "Mouse key board for the T14. It is a separate small PCB.\nWires join J16 pins 1, 2, 3 to pins 1, 2, 3 of the AUX header J9 on the hub.\nA wire joins J16 pin 4 to J9 pin 5 (GND).\nMK_GND is a local net. It becomes hub GND through that wire."
